: false}, {"t_ms": 8089, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01968JXQZgVw8Ci5m2GJAm5F", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 9359, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01E5CZBBc5AG1qsXpkdLWtCt", "tool": "wait_for_ci", "args": {"run_id": "ci-0001", "max_wait_s": 900, "confidence": 0.92}, "confidence": 0.92}, {"t_ms": 368089, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01E5CZBBc5AG1qsXpkdLWtCt", "tool": "wait_for_ci", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 368089, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01E5CZBBc5AG1qsXpkdLWtCt", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 370395, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_0196icsMWkgow9JQzXWFRRFv", "tool": "open_pr", "args": {"head": "fix/money-banker-rounding-fin-212", "base": "main", "title": "Use ROUND_HALF_EVEN in round_money (FIN-212)", "body": "## Summary\nThe nightly build of payments-service fails in `tests/test_money.py`, which expects banker's rounding per FIN-212. `src/money.py` imported and used `ROUND_HALF_UP`, even though its docstring says ROUND_HALF_EVEN.\n\nThis PR switches `round_money` to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`.\n\n## Changes\n- `src/money.py`: `ROUND_HALF_UP` -> `ROUND_HALF_EVEN` in the `quantize` call and import.\n\n## Verification\n- CI run `ci-0001` on commit `08d3cd5986`: passed.\n- Expected values: 2.675 -> 2.68, 2.665 -> 2.66 (half-to-even).\n\nRef: FIN-212", "reviewers": ["alex"], "idempotency_key": "pr-fin-212-08d3cd5986", "confidence": 0.9}, "confidence": 0.9}, {"t_ms": 371295, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_0196icsMWkgow9JQzXWFRRFv", "tool": "open_pr", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "pr-fin-212-08d3cd5986", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 371295, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_0196icsMWkgow9JQzXWFRRFv", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 373167, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I fixed the nightly failure and opened PR #101 against main with alex as reviewer. I did not merge it.\n\n- **Cause:** `src/money.py` imported and used `ROUND_HALF_UP`, even though its docstring and FIN-212 call for banker's rounding.\n- **Fix:** I changed it to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN` on branch `fix/money-banker-rounding-fin-212`, commit `08d3cd5986`. The test expects 2.675 \u2192 2.68 and 2.665 \u2192 2.66, which is what half-even gives.\n- **CI:** run `ci-0001` on that commit passed.\n- **PR:** https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101, targeting main, reviewer alex.\n\nMerging into main needs approval from a code owner, so the PR stays open until one approves it.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I'll start by reading the test and the source file to see what's expected.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_014KusizyTMeAnLUmb4Dfj4k", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "tests/test_money.py", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_0146u4p9J9i17JAqQFtd3GJV", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "src/money.py", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The test expects half-even rounding: 2.675 \u2192 2.68 and 2.665 \u2192 2.66. The source has the docstring saying ROUND_HALF_EVEN but passes ROUND_HALF_UP. I'll make a branch, fix that, and commit.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_017W2Z8V17AVzcGHAfdg8azQ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/money-banker-rounding-fin-212", "from_ref": "main", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "create_branch", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_018sFcWh4CGFZDEHsEQU1n7v", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/money-banker-rounding-fin-212", "message": "Use ROUND_HALF_EVEN in round_money (FIN-212)\n\nround_money imported and used ROUND_HALF_UP, contrary to the docstring and\nFIN-212 which require banker's rounding. Switch to ROUND_HALF_EVEN so that\ntests/test_money.py passes.", "files": [{"path": "src/money.py", "content": "from decimal import Decimal, ROUND_HALF_EVEN\n\n\ndef round_money(amount: Decimal) -> Decimal:\n    \"\"\"Round to cents using banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN), per FIN-212.\"\"\"\n    return amount.quantize(Decimal(\"0.01\"), rounding=ROUND_HALF_EVEN)\n"}], "confidence": 0.9}, "name": "commit_changes", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "The fix is committed. Next I'll start CI on the branch.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01968JXQZgVw8Ci5m2GJAm5F", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"ref": "fix/money-banker-rounding-fin-212", "idempotency_key": "ci-fin-212-08d3cd5986", "confidence": 0.92}, "name": "trigger_ci", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01E5CZBBc5AG1qsXpkdLWtCt", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"run_id": "ci-0001", "max_wait_s": 900, "confidence": 0.92}, "name": "wait_for_ci", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "CI passed on the branch. Next I'll open the pull request against main and request alex as reviewer.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_0196icsMWkgow9JQzXWFRRFv", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"head": "fix/money-banker-rounding-fin-212", "base": "main", "title": "Use ROUND_HALF_EVEN in round_money (FIN-212)", "body": "## Summary\nThe nightly build of payments-service fails in `tests/test_money.py`, which expects banker's rounding per FIN-212. `src/money.py` imported and used `ROUND_HALF_UP`, even though its docstring says ROUND_HALF_EVEN.\n\nThis PR switches `round_money` to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`.\n\n## Changes\n- `src/money.py`: `ROUND_HALF_UP` -> `ROUND_HALF_EVEN` in the `quantize` call and import.\n\n## Verification\n- CI run `ci-0001` on commit `08d3cd5986`: passed.\n- Expected values: 2.675 -> 2.68, 2.665 -> 2.66 (half-to-even).\n\nRef: FIN-212", "reviewers": ["alex"], "idempotency_key": "pr-fin-212-08d3cd5986", "confidence": 0.9}, "name": "open_pr", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I fixed the nightly failure and opened PR #101 against main with alex as reviewer. I did not merge it.\n\n- **Cause:** `src/money.py` imported and used `ROUND_HALF_UP`, even though its docstring and FIN-212 call for banker's rounding.\n- **Fix:** I changed it to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN` on branch `fix/money-banker-rounding-fin-212`, commit `08d3cd5986`. The test expects 2.675 \u2192 2.68 and 2.665 \u2192 2.66, which is what half-even gives.\n- **CI:** run `ci-0001` on that commit passed.\n- **PR:** https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101, targeting main, reviewer alex.\n\nMerging into main needs approval from a code owner, so the PR stays open until one approves it.", "type": "text"}]}]}